        "5) $4+25y=6+24y$；　　7) $4y+7=-3+5y$；",
        "6) $11-5x=12-6x$；　　8) $6-2y=8-3y$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "623",
      "box": null,
