      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "623. 求下列方程的根：",
        "1) $5x+3=2x$；　　5) $6k-100=9k-1$；",
        "2) $-0.4a-14=0.3a$；　6) $4.7-8x=4.9-10x$；",
        "3) $8x-25=3x+30$；　7) $7.3a=1.6a$；",
        "4) $6.9-9m=-5m-33.1$；8) $-19m=11m$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "624",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "624. 解方程并检验：",
        "1) $-40\\cdot(-7x+5)=-1600$；",
        "2) $2.1\\cdot(4-6a)=-42$；",
        "3) $(-20x-50)\\cdot2=100$；",
        "4) $-3\\cdot(2-15x)=-6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "625",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "625. 第一个桶里的牛奶是第二桶的3倍. 如果把第一个桶",
        "里的牛奶倒入第二个桶里20升，则两个桶里的牛奶相",
        "等. 每个桶里原有多少升牛奶？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "626",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "626. 线段$AB$比线段$CD$长2厘米. 如果把线段$AB$增加10",
        "厘米，而把线段$CD$延长到原长的3倍，则结果相等. 求",
        "线段$AB$长."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
